  "system": {
    "subType": "cyberware",
    "description": "<p><strong>Price $750 &middot; Concealment Sight &middot; System Strain 1</strong></p><p>Crude slabs of muscle and synthetic sinew are stitched onto the user's limbs and torso. Grants a +1 bonus to Strength modifier and a -1 penalty to Charisma modifier (the book caps these at a maximum +2 and minimum -2 respectively if stacked with other sources -- not enforced by this single +1/-1 Active Effect).</p><p><em>Optional \"Cheap Cyber\" rule (p.228); as a rule, the benefits of this low-grade cyber do not stack with other cyber of a similar kind.</em></p>",
